    "title": "Use the You area",
    "path": "7 Messages notifications profile preferences and help > Use the You area",
    "content": "Section\nCommon choices\nEveryday\nMessages Notifications Saved and My Expressions\nParticipate\nPrayer Giving Events and COT AI\nApp\nApp tour and help plus Floating menu recovery\nMinistry\nRole based General COT creation care people finance media and settings tools\nAccount\nProfile and account Tools and Sign out",
