    "order": 20,
    "title": "Manage sermons",
    "path": "3 Lead and operate General COT > Manage sermons",
    "content": "Sermon management supports drafts and publishing for church-wide messages. Add the title, preacher, message date, description or rich sermon notes, Scripture references, topics, banner, and available audio or video. Review the written sermon and media before publication. Media can continue processing while the written message is already readable.",
    "sourceDocumentId": "13AM5RK4CuJffYe9zIF2iew1VWBneg7YrskL4dNh23hU",
