    "audience": "ministry",
    "order": 25,
    "title": "Open Expression Operations",
    "path": "4 Lead and operate an Expression > Open Expression Operations",
    "content": "Enter the Expression, open its menu, and choose Operations or Manage Expression. Only tools granted by your role appear. The header always names the Expression so that private work is not confused with church-wide administration.",
