    "title": "Create Expression content",
    "path": "4 Lead and operate an Expression > Create Expression content",
    "content": "Content Studio opens the compact Studio screen for posts, Reels, videos, and teaching in the current Expression. Every creation screen should identify the Expression, and private publishing choices say that the content stays inside it. Expression announcements, events, sermons, and live streams follow the same familiar workflows as General COT but use the private member audience.",
