    "audience": "ministry",
    "order": 28,
    "title": "Manage Expression announcements and events",
    "path": "4 Lead and operate an Expression > Manage Expression announcements and events",
    "content": "For an announcement, enter title and message, add an optional flyer, then save a draft, schedule it, or publish it. For an event, add title, description, optional banner, dates, venue, online or hybrid status, capacity, and visibility. Use lifecycle statuses to keep cancelled, completed, or archived items out of the upcoming list.",
