    "id": "ministry-30",
    "audience": "ministry",
    "order": 29,
    "title": "Review prayer and testimony",
    "path": "4 Lead and operate an Expression > Review prayer and testimony",
    "content": "The Prayer inbox shows only requests routed to the prayer responsibilities held in that Expression. Use the same Praying, Answered, wall approval, and wall removal controls within the Expression boundary.\nTestimony review keeps the member and ministry team in one private record. Reviewers can respond, record notes, invite a consenting member to share physically, and update the workflow status. Managers may also export a private testimony PDF when needed.",
    "sourceDocumentId": "13AM5RK4CuJffYe9zIF2iew1VWBneg7YrskL4dNh23hU",
    "sourceRevision": "ANLCKQknhtrWTZdesE6Mug-iy54zUgrLX9rAcjMfXGBPtTKIvhHb_jajWNETo1LHLmcxHlhc1AlvPVfH43p-35QFejVC69Swsf-RLft-Tzs"
